sequenceDiagram
    participant HostApp as Consuming Laravel App
    participant QD as Queue Dispatcher
    participant Queue as Laravel Queue
    participant Worker as Queue Worker
    participant RM as Revision Manager

    HostApp->>QD: transitionBulk(entities, event)
    QD->>QD: group by event and model revision, split into fixed-size batches
    QD->>Queue: dispatch(BatchTransitionJob) x M
    Queue-->>Worker: pop job (one batch)
    loop each entity in batch
        Worker->>RM: transition(entity, event)
        RM-->>Worker: new state
    end
    Worker-->>Queue: job complete
